From the WCST 8.00 spoilers (what is finished yet):

You will need to explore level 55 until you find a spot that says "You
feel a strange vibration under your feet."  There is only one (random)
spot that says this, and there's no way I've been able to find out
which is the right spot other than just wandering around the whole
level (except playing in Wizard Mode).

Now then, make sure that your candelabrum is loaded.  You can do this
by activating the candles that you have.  It will ask you if you want
to put them in the candelabrum - say yes.  Then light the candelabrum
by activating it.  The candles will burn brightly.

Next, ring the Chime of Opening by activating it.

Finally, read the Book of the Dead.  In a pretty cool display of text
graphics an area will erupt around your feet, surrounding you with a
